flowchart LR
    A[Target User Sees Landing Page] --> B[Reads Problem and Value Proposition]
    B --> C[Clicks Call-to-Action]
    C --> D[Opens Prototype Demo or Main Workflow]
    D --> E[Submits / Searches / Views / Updates Data]
    E --> F[Metric Recorded]
    F --> G[Team Reviews Acquisition and Feedback]
    G --> H[Improve Message, CTA, or Prototype]
